---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';import {services,areas} from '../data/content';const root=import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---
<Base title="Plumbing help in Austin"><div class="hero"><div><h1>Plumbing help for the things that cannot wait.</h1><p>A leaking connection, a drain that keeps backing up, or a heater without hot water needs a clear next step. Explore the problem guides, then prepare the details a plumber will need to understand what is happening.</p><a class="button" href={`${root}contact/`}>View contact preview ↗</a><div class="quick"><strong>Start with the problem, not a guess.</strong><p>Which fixtures are affected? When did it start? Is water still flowing? Those details help shape the first conversation.</p></div></div><figure><img src={`${root}assets/plumber.jpg`} alt="Illustrative stock photo of hands using a wrench on a pipe" width="1500" height="1000" fetchpriority="high"/><figcaption>Illustrative stock photography. Not this business or its staff.</figcaption></figure></div>
<div class="wash"><section class="section"><h2>Find the right place to start.</h2><p>Each service guide explains a different problem and the information to gather before an inspection. The cause and suitable work still need to be checked at the property.</p><div class="grid">{services.map(s=><a class="card" href={`${root}services/${s.slug}/`}><h3>{s.title}</h3><p>{s.intro}</p><span class="arrow">Read the guide ↗</span></a>)}</div></section></div>
<section class="section split"><div><h2>A clearer first conversation.</h2><p>You do not need to diagnose the plumbing before calling. A few observations help explain the problem and avoid starting with the wrong assumption.</p><a class="button" href={`${root}services/`}>Explore services</a></div><div class="steps"><div class="step"><h3>Describe what changed.</h3><p>Name the affected fixtures, where water appears, and how long the issue has been happening.</p></div><div class="step"><h3>Confirm the scope.</h3><p>Ask whether the business covers the address and the type of work. Availability is confirmed by the business, not by this preview.</p></div><div class="step"><h3>Discuss the findings.</h3><p>The inspection should explain the likely cause and proposed work. Clearing an obstruction and repairing a pipe are different jobs.</p></div></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="callout"><h2>Built around the Austin area.</h2><p>Explore the area pages and the details to share when asking about service. These are demonstration routes, not a promise of coverage or an appointment.</p>{areas.map(a=><a class="pill" data-area={a.name} href={`${root}service-areas/${a.slug}/`}>{a.name} ↗</a>)}</div></section></Base>
